# StayNest repository-wide safety rules

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vercel/
**/coverage/

# Environment files and secrets (keep templates)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# Logs and local runtime output
*.log
**/server.err
**/.last-email
**/admin_test*.txt
**/test_out*.txt

# OS and editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json

# Frontend verification artifacts
frontend/_verify.txt
frontend/_print.cjs
